        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-purity water, cetyl alcohol, behentrimonium methosulfate, cocos nucifera (coconut) oil, butyrospermum parkii (shea butter) fruit, glyceryl stearate, polysorbate 20 (food-grade), sodium gluconate, phenoxyethanol, caprylyl glycol</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><em>Your choice of –</em></p><p><strong>Pure essential oils</strong> • hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.</p><p><em>and/or</em></p><p><strong>Phthalate-free fragrance oils</strong> • aromatic compounds made of GRAS safe synthetics. Certified free of the 624 carcinogens and 323 reproductive/developmental toxins listed under the <a href=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\" target=\"_blank\">Prop 65 act</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_74HWQb": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cetyl-alcohol-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Cetyl Alcohol</strong></a><strong> </strong>(softens, smooths hair)</p><p>Behentrimonium Methosulfate (plant-based detangler)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coconut-oil-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\"><strong>Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil</strong></a><strong> </strong><br/>(moisturizes and seals)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-shea-butter-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-shea-butter-and-what-does-it-do-in-hair-products\"><strong>Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter)</strong> <strong>Fruit</strong></a><strong> </strong>(moisturizes)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glyceryl-stearate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Glyceryl Stearate</strong></a> (veggie-based, protective barrier. PEG-free) </p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a> (plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(helps hydrate scalp and follicles)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol </strong>(preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong> and/or </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Fragrance Oils?\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a> (scent)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gawyR4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I custom build my own scent?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><em>It's pretty simple! </em></p><p>In the drop down menus you'll be able to select two of our 50+ available scents</p><p>We compound these two scents together and make sure they are compatible with/perform in our product. Our fragrance department has nearly a decade of experience working with scents, and will make sure that the two scents you chose can be smelled equally in the product you ordered.</p><p>If you are looking for something customized outside of this scope to suit your brand, visit our <a href=\"/pages/private-label-information\" title=\"Private Label Information\">Private Label Solutions Page</a> for more information.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Vtcafw": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul><p><strong>Retail Ready Case (2 oz, 4 oz & 16 oz) : </strong>Retail Ready products come as shown in the case image. Pump, Sprayer or Flip-Top Cap is included if shown.</p><p>No pump is available for the <strong>24 oz Glass Jug</strong>. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
